            "type": "text",
            "content": "心室壁增厚必然使充盈压降低, 从而减少肺静脉回流",
            "correct": false,
            "option_id": "76fc2e14-5e33-4e2c-affe-ac4fdc862b1f"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "LVEF 保留说明 RAAS 不会激活, 因此不可能发生水钠潴留",
            "correct": false,
            "option_id": "210de5e1-3814-4ce8-97f0-1615655edd5d"
          }
        ],
